abstract: "The complete Obsidian vault of the Structural Delimitation Framework (SDF): foundations, lattice geometry (pentagonal frustration, Berry-phase gauge), thermodynamics/Noether invariance, emergent physics, observational mapping (Pantheon+ fits), validation/simulation, and the rank-ladder glossary. Every note carries uniform frontmatter (created, license, zenodo_section). The f_c = κ[rad/s]/π unit convention and the exact identity f_c·τ_d = 1/2 are registered here and carried family-wide. Model-level claims with executed numerical protocols; no empirical cosmological claim is made."
